Package: tind-ai-ui
Version: 0.1.0~test7
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Morten <morten@servr.no>
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Depends: tind-ai-users, tind-ai-local, tind-ai-remote, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, pkexec
Installed-Size: 128
Suggests: libreoffice-writer
Description: Tind AI box: the chat window (Super+K)
 Write a request, choose what to share (system log, Tind report, Steam and
 Proton logs, files), see the exact redacted text and the provider before it is
 sent, and read the answer. Nothing in an answer runs by itself. Each model
 carries a coloured price mark (Prices page in the menu). Chats are kept as
 Markdown files in ~/TindAI/ChatArchive, documents from an answer are saved to
 ~/TindAI/Documents as Markdown, or as Word, PDF or ODT when LibreOffice Writer
 is installed, and Export writes the Tind report and logs, redacted by
 default, to ~/TindAI/Export for AI apps outside the window.
